  "Material names used as evidence (not in basis): HoseMat for mesh 0 (single island, so named a hose assembly; geometry alone would only say dark brown central lump), LensesMat for mesh 5 (two matching components at x 0.2/0.8 -> Lens_Left/Lens_Right), LeatherPartsMat for mesh 4 prefix 'Leather_', RubberWoodMat/GlassPlasticMat/MetalPartsMat used only loosely as colour/material hints in names.",
  "I cannot say what the whole object is; evidence gives a central dark body with side pairs and a lot of small bright/brown parts. Names for most parts are shape/colour/position descriptors on purpose.",
  "Left/right: I took low x = Left, high x = Right and low z = Back, high z = Front; the evidence does not say which side the model's own left is. Mesh 3 is symmetric about at-x ~0.60, not 0.5, so 'centre' pairs (27/34) are named Centre_Left/Right.",
